  "description": "The night Yun Iseo strikes it rich, fate hits him with a truck, transporting him into a bizarre magical world. To his absolute horror, he isn't just an ordinary summon, he is worshipped as a supreme god, and the realm's national religion is based entirely on the embarrassing dark-fantasy novel he wrote in middle school. But after an unexpected kiss from a dashing savior pulls him into a whirlwind of dangerous suitors, escaping back to reality becomes a battle of wits, magic, and pure seduction. Now, while dodging bizarre perils and faking his way through divine duties, Iseo has only one goal: find a way back home to his lottery fortune. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
